  "title": "PCEP: Implement dissection of ASSOC-Type-list TLV (Type 35)",
  "description": "PCEP Protocol: The ASSOC-TYpe-list TLV (Type 35) was recognized, but its content dissection was not yet available. The proposed changes implement the dissection of the ASSOC-Type-list TLV, defined in https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc8697. It contains a number of ASSOC-Types . The ASSOC-Type fields names are taken from IANA https://www.iana.org/assignments/pcep/pcep.xhtml#association-type-field. \n\nAttached a pcap file were in the open object the assoc-type-list TLV: [OPEN_message_with_assoc_type_list_tlv.pcapng](/uploads/10b3f9b3d27a57709ec955dd7a8a0ba6/OPEN_message_with_assoc_type_list_tlv.pcapng)\n\nScreenshot of the capture with the proposed change: ![assoc_type_list_tlv_screenshot](/uploads/bc91bb15ee48ce691c15baeb227f1b3c/assoc_type_list_tlv_screenshot.PNG)",
